<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-20026] Java thin client does not allow ports greater than 49151</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-20026</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;TcpClientChannel.validateConfiguration&lt;/b&gt; rejects ports outside of 1024 - 49151 range (&lt;a href=&quot;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Registered_port&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Registered_port&lt;/a&gt;), for no good reason. Remove this limitation.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
